@CalendarParse.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150

### Health check (no auth required)
GET {{CalendarParse.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Sentry test (no auth required) — sends a message + exception to Sentry
GET {{CalendarParse.Api_HostAddress}}/sentry-test
Accept: application/json

